  position     String // Pembina, Pengawas, or a Pengurus office: Ketua, Sekretaris, Bendahara
  phone        String?
  email        String?
  photoUrl     String?   @map("photo_url")
  /// Unknown until an admin enters it from the appointment deed — never guessed.
